      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;a-dialog-with-jeff-foster&#34;&gt;A Dialog with Jeff Foster&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/trad_neo/jeff_dialog.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Jeff Foster and Dennis Waite&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955399904/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/life_without.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/life_without.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The following is a dialog that I had with Jeff Foster in June 2007, after I had read his book &amp;lsquo;Life Without a Centre: awakening from the dream of separation&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Read an &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/silence_foster.htm&#34;&gt;extract from the book&lt;/a&gt; (referred to below).&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Purcase from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955399904/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;Amazon.com&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/0955399904/thespiritupat-21&#34;&gt;Amazon.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Link to &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.lifewithoutacentre.com&#34;&gt;Jeff&amp;rsquo;s website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In the discussion below, my words are in blue (Dennis Waite) and Jeff&amp;rsquo;s are in red (Jeff Foster).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
